    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Riding a flying dragon, catching pets, fighting demons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a turn based combat adventure game with a partial plot. The protagonist Aaron is summoned to a strange place and will then meet two other companions to embark on a journey, experience various adventures, and ultimately save the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains various equipment, with categories from weak to strong: white&lt;green&lt;blue&lt;purple; Having several types of recovery potions, reinforcement potions, and some special items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are three professions in total, each with its own skills and talents. Skills are fixed and unlocked according to the character's level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warrior: Tank profession, used to absorb enemy hatred and help teammates reduce damage. The attacks of Warrior profession have high hatred value, and enemies will attack first;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Archer: a physical output profession that can break through enemy armor and deal a lot of damage. At the same time, after level 10, it can capture some monsters as pets to help tanks distribute damage;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mage: Spell output profession and wet nurse, dealing a large amount of spell damage to enemies and protecting teammates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each profession has its own talents, and the talent system will be unlocked after level 10. Talent can be freely selected to add points, and the talent points increase with the character's level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contains various tasks and partial plot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When players reach full experience on 9/19/29/39, they need to complete specific tasks to kill the corresponding leader boss in order to level up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy battles are divided into two types</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ordinary and Elite Monsters: Randomly release skills;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss: Release skills by turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome friends to come and experience it.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Riding a flying dragon, catching pets, fighting demons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a turn based combat adventure game with a partial plot. The protagonist Aaron is summoned to a strange place and will then meet two other companions to embark on a journey, experience various adventures, and ultimately save the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains various equipment, with categories from weak to strong: white&lt;green&lt;blue&lt;purple; Having several types of recovery potions, reinforcement potions, and some special items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are three professions in total, each with its own skills and talents. Skills are fixed and unlocked according to the character's level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warrior: Tank profession, used to absorb enemy hatred and help teammates reduce damage. The attacks of Warrior profession have high hatred value, and enemies will attack first;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Archer: a physical output profession that can break through enemy armor and deal a lot of damage. At the same time, after level 10, it can capture some monsters as pets to help tanks distribute damage;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mage: Spell output profession and wet nurse, dealing a large amount of spell damage to enemies and protecting teammates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each profession has its own talents, and the talent system will be unlocked after level 10. Talent can be freely selected to add points, and the talent points increase with the character's level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contains various tasks and partial plot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When players reach full experience on 9/19/29/39, they need to complete specific tasks to kill the corresponding leader boss in order to level up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy battles are divided into two types</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ordinary and Elite Monsters: Randomly release skills;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss: Release skills by turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome friends to come and experience it.</p>",
